  <steps>
    <step order="1">Create the folder RecordHeader/ if not already present.</step>
    <step order="2">Declare IRecordHeaderShellProps { toolbar: IHeaderToolbarProps; loading?: boolean; children: React.ReactNode; } in types.ts.</step>
    <step order="3">Implement RecordHeaderShell.tsx: Fluent v9 card container (colorNeutralBackground1 + colorNeutralStroke1 border + borderRadiusMedium), HeaderToolbar rendered at top, body slot below.</step>
    <step order="4">On loading===true, render a small Fluent Skeleton grid (3 columns, 2 rows) instead of children.</step>
    <step order="5">Write __tests__/RecordHeaderShell.test.tsx covering: toolbar renders in header; children render in body when not loading; Skeleton renders when loading.</step>
    <step order="6">Run npm test in shared lib.</step>
